WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
What's going on in Changgu Town?

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:03,520
After you left last night

3
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:06,360
Changgu town was attacked by Luoyun tribe

4
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:08,240
We were caught off guard

5
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:09,720
Lost

6
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:21,310
You guys are the only ones left.

7
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:30,980
What about Commander Wei?

8
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:32,420
He is innately incompetent

9
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:33,700
It shouldn't be that easy to die, right?

10
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:35,570
Standing till the end last night

11
00:00:35,810 --> 00:00:37,370
Commander Wei discovered Weiwu Camp

12
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:39,930
Losing to the people of Luoyun tribe, I am alone

13
00:00:39,930 --> 00:00:41,730
Led the remaining people of the Luo tribe away

14
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:46,380
Now his whereabouts are unknown, please take a look.

15
00:00:46,380 --> 00:00:49,100
Which direction did Commander Wei run to? Boss?

16
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:51,180
Half a day has passed

17
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:53,300
He must have become more and more vicious.

18
00:00:54,090 --> 00:00:55,090
Live to meet people

19
00:00:55,610 --> 00:00:56,930
I want to see the corpse after death
